  info:
  - 'Deploys a ballistic shield for an unlimited duration. The shield can be lowered
    at any time. While active, Beast and nearby allies/hostages take no damage from
    bullets or shrapnel, but Beast cannot shoot while using it. Shield durability
    decreases when absorbing bullet or explosive damage.  '
  - 'Places C4 at the selected location. Using the skill again detonates the explosive.
    Detonating an already placed C4 does not consume an additional charge.  '
  - 'Disarms tripwires in radius  '
